WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.775
Sync engines, explained with playgrounds you can poke at.

2
00:00:07.078 --> 00:00:10.678
Send the whole text, and someone's edit just vanishes.

3
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.950
OT has a server shift each edit around the other, so both survive.

4
00:00:27.506 --> 00:00:31.956
A CRDT merges both on each device, no server needed.

5
00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:39.508
And four quick questions suggest where to start.
